{"id":"n61296-1-4","stage":3,"title":"사진관 · 照相馆","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61296-1-4-1","ko":"여권을 만들려면 여권 사진이 필요하다는데?","zh":"听说办护照需要护照照片，对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여권을","meaning":"护照","explanation":"여권：护照；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여권","audio":"/audio/03ed7a436dd264d1c2ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70992","senseId":"1","lemma":"여권","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만들려면","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여권","meaning":"护照","explanation":"여권：护照","readings":[{"term":"여권","audio":"/audio/03ed7a436dd264d1c2ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70992","senseId":"1","lemma":"여권","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사진이","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"필요하다는데?","meaning":"必需，必要","explanation":"필요하다：必需，必要；다는데：转述听到的情况，并留下确认、补充或对照的语气。","readings":[{"term":"필요하다","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46945","senseId":"1","lemma":"필요하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"03ed7a436dd264d1","term":"여권","zh":"护照","audio":"/audio/03ed7a436dd264d1c2ca.mp3","entryId":"70992","definition":"证明去他国旅行的人的身份或国籍，在旅行国家要求保护的文件。","pronunciation":["여꿘"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"b98947c9698402e3","term":"필요하다","zh":"必需，必要","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3","entryId":"46945","definition":"一定要有的。","pronunciation":["피료하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/928197e276cde81f1cc5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61296-1-4-2","ko":"그럼 오늘 사진관에 다녀와야겠다.","zh":"那今天得去照相馆拍照片了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사진관에","meaning":"照相馆","explanation":"사진관：照相馆；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사진관","audio":"/audio/94c9bface3575774b0fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61296","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀와야겠다.","meaning":"去一趟，去一下","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去一下；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"2","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"94c9bface3575774","term":"사진관","zh":"照相馆","audio":"/audio/94c9bface3575774b0fe.mp3","entryId":"61296","definition":"配备了设施并专门从事拍照的地方。","pronunciation":["사진관"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去一下","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"为做某事而去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/62519b57b99d94199c10.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.87,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61296","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":102,"sequenceScore":2.6967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那今天得去照相馆拍照片了。","听说办护照需要护照照片，对吧？","下巴上沾了东西哦。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说办护照需要护照照片，对吧？","下巴上沾了东西哦。","那今天得去照相馆拍照片了。"],"answer":2}]}
